/TU (Part 9\056 General Eligibility and Inadmissibility Grounds\056 Criminal Acts and Violations\056 36\056 Have you EVER induced by force\054 fraud\054 or coercion \050or otherwise been involved in\051 the trafficking of another person for commercial sex acts \050sex trafficking\051\077 Select Yes\056 NOTE\072 Sex trafficking involves inducing or causing an adult to engage in a commercial sex act \050any sex act performed for anything of value\051 through fraud\054 force\054 or coercion\054 or inducing or causing any person under 18 years of age to engage in a commercial sex act \050even without force\054 fraud\054 or coercion\051\056 Sex trafficking may include recruiting\054 enticing\054 harboring\054 transporting\054 providing\054 obtaining\054 advertising\054 maintaining\054 patronizing\054 or soliciting by any means a person to engage in the commercial sex act knowing \050or\054 in the case of advertising\054 with reckless disregard of the fact\051 that the person is under 18 years of age or that force\054 fraud\054 or coercion was used to induce or cause the person to engage in the commercial sex act\056 Sex trafficking may also include knowingly benefiting financially or by receiving anything of value\054 from participation in a venture involving sex trafficking\056)
